<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs weak/off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were weak to $0.50 lower. Demand was moderate. Top $53.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2 230-260 lbs. 51.50-52.50, few 53.00</p>
<p>Sows - not well established.</p>
</text>
